# Office help keeps how-to answers

When Victor asks how something works or how to operate the portal, and you explain the steps, write that into Office help in the same turn.

## Where

- Lessons: `working_ui/portal/admin_office_help.json`
- Cache query on `DATA_URL` in `working_ui/admin_office_help.html` (bump when the JSON changes)
- Bump the JSON `version` field to match

## What to save

- Repeatable office steps: where to click, which type/field marks the action, what the worker and parents then see.
- Add keywords in English and the Spanish words Victor uses (`shadowing`, `entrevista`, `como anado`).
- Update an existing lesson when the topic is already there. Add a new lesson when it is a new flow.
- ASCII punctuation only.

## What to leave out

- One-off people, money figures, private messages, and bug investigations.
- Do not paste the chat. Write short steps and tips in the same voice as the other lessons.
